    {
      "text": "The system shall continuously monitor the operator’s attentiveness and issue an escalated takeover request if the operator fails to respond within a defined time window."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall maintain a minimum safe stopping distance from all detected objects, dynamically adjusting for vehicle speed, road surface condition, and object classification."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall provide redundant sensor modalities (e.g., multiple lidar, radar, and camera units) with independent processing paths, and shall automatically transition to a safe state if a primary sensor or processing path fails."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall detect and correctly classify vulnerable road users (pedestrians, cyclists, children) at distances sufficient to guarantee a full stop before the point of conflict under all operating speeds."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall execute a controlled, minimum‑impact emergency stop (including safe‑brake activation and steering lock) if a critical fault is detected or if the operator does not take control after a takeover request."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall validate and limit its operational design domain (ODD) in real time, disengaging if environmental conditions (e.g., rain, glare, low‑light, road markings) fall outside validated parameters."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall encrypt all internal and external communications and protect against unauthorized code injection, ensuring cybersecurity integrity of the ADS."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall log, with timestamp and sensor fidelity, all perception, prediction, planning, and control decisions, as well as operator interventions, for post‑incident analysis."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall undergo functional safety verification (e.g., ISO 26262 ASIL D) for all safety‑critical software components, with documented safety goals and validation evidence."
    },
    {
      "text": "The system shall provide a clear, unambiguous visual and auditory status indication to the operator about ADS mode, health, and any pending takeover request."
    }
  ]
